        "description": "<ul>\n<li>Author avatar, name, tagline, and description</li>\n<li>&#8220;Cite this article&#8221; toggle with a formatted APA-style citation</li>\n<li>One-click copy to clipboard</li>\n<li>&#8220;Reformat citation style&#8221; link with prefilled details</li>\n<li>Gutenberg block: &#8220;Author Box with Citation&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>author-box-citation</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Insert the block in any post, or use the shortcode.</li>\n</ol>\n",
